m  to make money by covering this stuff on  tv  it's not new that they abandon their  values when it's inconvenient this is  just the latest way  think back when democrats are in the  white house  all they talk about is debt and deficit  and the importance of balancing the  budget  george w bush comes into office among  other things give tax cuts to the rich  and goes to war  a really expensive war with the wrong  country and in so doing  explodes the deficit and they say  nothing  but then donald trump comes into office  and then cuts taxes for  the rich blows up the deficit again  and they say nothing at all and yet not  only  do they abandon their values when it's  not convenient  they want to inject government into it  when a market guides  a decision that they don't like and look  at the trajectory  on this dr seuss thing we are for free  markets and keeping government  out this means you would imagine  businesses do what they want as long as  it's not illegal and the government  stays out of it  dr seuss enterprises which made more  than 30 million dollars last year  decides here's six books we will not  continue to publish  they're not canceling dr seuss they're  not burning  books they're saying here's six books we  will allow to go out of print but if you  want to buy a used copy you can go ahead  and all of a sudden the sovereignty of  business to do what it wants to do  goes out the window but not only that  republicans including people like jim  jordan the congressman demand  congressional hearings on cancel culture  why is any of this the business of the  federal government  where is rand paul as a principled  libertarian  to say there is nothing for the federal  government to do related to this  we should have no role here whatsoever  hearings  no way in hell these are private  businesses making decisions however they  want to make them  they're not breaking any law so quite  simply the government should have no  involvement whatsoever  the market as t